i_timer: I_WaitVBL waits

It was empty, so quitting from the menu ended before its sound was heard (m_menu.c waits 105 VBLs
of 70 Hz, 1.5 s, for it).

--- a/doomgeneric/i_timer.c	2026-10-11 06:12:25.000000000 -0700
+++ b/doomgeneric/i_timer.c	2026-10-14 20:02:12.551459281 -0700
@@ -83,7 +83,7 @@
 
 void I_WaitVBL(int count)
 {
-    //I_Sleep((count * 1000) / 70);
+    I_Sleep((count * 1000) / 70);
 }
 
 
